# App version badge

The header `vX.Y.Z` comes from `package.json` via `/api/config`.

After a **product fix** or **enhancement**, run:

```bash
node scripts/sync-app-version.js
```

Do **not** bump for docs, README/START-HERE copy, comments, tests-only, `mapping.properties`, or other minor non-product edits.

`npm start` already runs this (at most one bump until the version is committed). Do not hand-edit the badge in `public/index.html` unless the script is unavailable.
